{"title":"Antlion Warrior","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 23 Antlion that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>7</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>23</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>7</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"antlion-warrior\" data-map-level=\"23\">Show level 23 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 12 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"antlion-mandible\" title=\"Antlion Mandible - in 83% of 12 looted corpses, 10 recorded drops, 21 total, 1–5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3af9398e31b21e1c0d76.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Antlion Mandible</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">83% · 10/12</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"chitin-plate\" title=\"Chitin Plate - in 75% of 12 looted corpses, 9 recorded drops, 11 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e7a114aeae3b63b5e56d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Chitin Plate</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">75% · 9/12</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-medium\" title=\"Mana Potion Medium - in 17% of 12 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dce7b61a763deccad88f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">17% · 2/12</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-medium\" title=\"Health Potion Medium - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6003f0952eddf298b4c8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+4 more\">+4 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-feet\" title=\"Bearhide Feet - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/194881d2e0ebbc92b3cd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-legs\" title=\"Bearhide Legs - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d5f0c0f64a5f6fd492e9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-medium\" title=\"Stamina Potion Medium - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/df992b2657b50a24d683.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-head\" title=\"Bearhide Head (weasel x1) - in 8% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b31cec1ed7b01d27c08d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 1/12</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1 · Enchanted: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Antlion Hive</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 8</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-183\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-435.5px,-1330.2px)\"><img src=\"tiles/4/0/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/0/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/1/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/1/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/2/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/2/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:1280px\"><i style=\"left:603.7px;top:1294.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:354.7px;top:1349.8px\"></i></div><figcaption>Skentz Scrapyard</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"antlion-warrior\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Antlion: <a href=\"#/monster/antlion-pitling\">Antlion Pitling</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/antlion\">Antlion</a> <span class=\"muted\">(19)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/antlion-queen\">Antlion Queen</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><d